sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant DSPA as Data Science Pipelines<br/>Application
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Teacher as Teacher Model<br/>(KServe)<br/>HTTPS
    participant Git as Taxonomy Git Repo<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PVC as PVC<br/>(ReadWriteMany)
    participant TrainOp as Training Operator<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Workers as Training Workers<br/>(PyTorchJob)
    participant Judge as Judge Model<br/>(KServe)<br/>HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,MR: Phase 1: Pipeline Submission
    User->>DSPA: Upload pipeline.yaml
    DSPA->>DSPA: Schedule pipeline run

    Note over User,MR: Phase 2: Prerequisite Validation
    DSPA->>K8sAPI: Check secrets, CRDs<br/>Auth: Bearer (SA token)
    K8sAPI-->>DSPA: Validation results
    DSPA->>Teacher: Health check<br/>Auth: Bearer (api_token)
    Teacher-->>DSPA: OK
    DSPA->>Judge: Health check<br/>Auth: Bearer (api_token)
    Judge-->>DSPA: OK
    DSPA->>MR: Connectivity check<br/>Auth: Bearer (SA token)
    MR-->>DSPA: OK

    Note over User,MR: Phase 3: Synthetic Data Generation (SDG)
    DSPA->>Git: Clone taxonomy repo<br/>Auth: Basic auth / SSH key
    Git-->>DSPA: Taxonomy data
    DSPA->>Teacher: POST /chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer (api_token)<br/>TLS (system CA)
    Teacher-->>DSPA: Synthetic training data
    DSPA->>PVC: Write SDG output to /data

    Note over User,MR: Phase 4: Distributed Training
    DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create PyTorchJob<br/>Auth: Bearer (SA token)
    K8sAPI->>TrainOp: Schedule PyTorchJob
    TrainOp->>Workers: Launch master + workers<br/>(FSDP, Istio disabled)
    Workers->>PVC: Read /input_data, write /output
    Workers->>Workers: PyTorch RDZV (TCP, no TLS)
    Workers-->>TrainOp: Training complete
    TrainOp-->>DSPA: Job succeeded

    Note over User,MR: Phase 5: Evaluation
    DSPA->>Judge: POST /chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer (api_token)<br/>TLS (system CA)
    Judge-->>DSPA: MT-Bench + MMLU scores
    DSPA->>PVC: Read model, write eval results

    Note over User,MR: Phase 6: Model Output
    DSPA->>OCI: Push Modelcar image<br/>Auth: dockerconfigjson<br/>(skopeo + olot)
    OCI-->>DSPA: Push confirmed
    DSPA->>MR: Register model version<br/>Auth: Bearer (SA token)
    MR-->>DSPA: Model registered

    Note over User,MR: Pipeline Complete
    DSPA-->>User: Pipeline run succeeded
